% arising from its use.

the target language is: lps.

the maximum time is 4.

the events are:
    the contract the delivery obligation starts on day *a day*; known as contract_the_delivery_obligation_starts.
    *a party* does deliver the goods on day *a day*; known as does_deliver_the_goods.
    something happens on day *a day*; known as something_happens_on_day.
    *a party* does something on day *a day*; known as does_something_on_day.
    the clock reaches day *a day*; known as the_clock_reaches_day.
    the contract the complete sale contract starts on day *a day*; known as contract_the_complete_sale_contract_starts.
    *a party* does pay the invoice with amount *an amount* on day *a day*; known as does_pay_the_invoice.
    the contract the payment with late fee starts on day *a day*; known as contract_the_payment_with_late_fee_starts.
    the contract the wedding ceremony starts on day *a day*; known as contract_the_wedding_ceremony_starts.
    *a party* does exchange vows on day *a day*; known as does_exchange_vows.
    the contract the fidelity clause starts on day *a day*; known as contract_the_fidelity_clause_starts.
    *a party* does be unfaithful on day *a day*; known as does_be_unfaithful.
    *a party* does cancel the order on day *a day*; known as does_cancel_the_order.

the fluents are:
    the delivery obligation obliges *a party* to deliver the goods by day *a due day* as its first obligation; known as o_the_delivery_obligation_1.
    the complete sale contract obliges *a party* to deliver the goods by day *a due day* as its first obligation; known as o_the_complete_sale_contract_1.
    the payment with late fee obliges *a party* to pay the invoice with amount *an amount* by day *a due day* as its first obligation; known as o_the_payment_with_late_fee_1.
    the wedding ceremony obliges *a party* to exchange vows by day *a due day* as its first obligation; known as o_the_wedding_ceremony_1.
    the fidelity clause forbids *a party* to be unfaithful as its first obligation; known as o_the_fidelity_clause_1.
    the contract is fulfilled; known as the_contract_is_fulfilled.
    the contract is breached; known as the_contract_is_breached.
    the complete sale contract obliges *a party* to pay the invoice with amount *an amount* by day *a due day* as its second obligation; known as o_the_complete_sale_contract_2.
    the complete sale contract permits *a party* to cancel the order as its third obligation; known as o_the_complete_sale_contract_3.
    the payment with late fee obliges *a party* to pay the invoice with amount *an amount* by day *a due day* as its second obligation; known as o_the_payment_with_late_fee_2.
    the wedding ceremony obliges *a party* to exchange vows by day *a due day* as its second obligation; known as o_the_wedding_ceremony_2.
    the contract is breached by *a party* because *a reason*; known as the_contract_is_breached_by_because.

